{
  "task_description": "{'component_name': 'Main Container for ClassroomConnect', 'description': 'Primary container for ClassroomConnect implementation: Classroom Insider is a web-based informal classroom collaboration platform where users can join or create classrooms using a unique 6-digit code. All users have equal privileges. Each classroom offers public chat, a bulletin board for reminders, a notebook for uploading notes by subject, group project management (with team formation, leader election, and task tracking), and audio/video calls. Users have unique 8-digit alphanumeric codes and a dashboard to view their classrooms. The UI is designed to be fun, simple, and student-friendly.', 'framework': 'react', 'platform': 'web', 'container': '{\n  "name": "ColorCraft frontend Container",\n  "features": [\n    {\n      "name": "Classroom Creation/Join",\n      "description": "Users can create or join classrooms using a unique 6-digit code. No admin roles; all users are equal.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Public Chat",\n      "description": "Each classroom has a public chat for all members to communicate.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Bulletin Board",\n      "description": "A shared space in each classroom where anyone can post reminders or announcements.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Notebook",\n      "description": "Upload and organize notes by subject, with support for file uploads.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Group Projects",\n      "description": "Form teams (randomly or by choice), elect a leader, assign tasks, and track progress with a progress bar.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "Audio/Video Calls",\n      "description": "Initiate audio or video calls within classrooms for real-time collaboration.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "User Unique Code",\n      "description": "Each user is assigned a unique 8-digit alphanumeric code upon registration.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    },\n    {\n      "name": "User Dashboard",\n      "description": "Users have a dashboard to view and access all their joined classrooms.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#4F8CFF",\n    "secondary": "#FFD166",\n    "accent": "#06D6A0"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The homepage features a playful, student-friendly design with bright colors and rounded elements. Users can create or join a classroom from the main screen. The dashboard displays joined classrooms as colorful cards. Inside a classroom, tabs or sections allow switching between Chat, Bulletin Board, Notebook, Group Projects, and Calls. Group project management uses drag-and-drop and progress bars. The UI is intuitive, with large buttons and minimal clutter, optimized for both desktop and mobile."\n}'}",
